# === RO e-Factura ANAF ===
# IMPORTANT: Toate setarile eFactura se administreaza din UI:
#   AdminV2 -> eFactura -> Configurare globala
# (fernet key, URL-uri ANAF, scheduler enabled, redirect URI etc.)
#
# Variabilele de mai jos sunt OPTIONALE - doar ca fallback la primul start
# inainte ca admin-ul sa salveze in DB. Lasa-le goale si configureaza in UI.
#
# ANAF_FERNET_KEY=
# ANAF_AUTH_URL=https://logincert.anaf.ro/anaf-oauth2/v1/authorize
# ANAF_TOKEN_URL=https://logincert.anaf.ro/anaf-oauth2/v1/token
# ANAF_API_BASE_PROD=https://api.anaf.ro/prod/FCTEL/rest
# ANAF_API_BASE_TEST=https://api.anaf.ro/test/FCTEL/rest
# ANAF_DEFAULT_REDIRECT_URI=https://app.berlinstar.ro/api/efactura/callback
# ANAF_FRONTEND_CALLBACK_REDIRECT=https://app.berlinstar.ro/adminv2?section=efactura
# EFACTURA_SCHEDULER_ENABLED=0
